{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting to Safari","generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"]}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Digital Credentials API, using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"network request from the wallet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Safari sends only ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Set up the app and its extension","anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The extension:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point "},{"code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The capability:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doctypes the app presents in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and Photo ID."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared storage:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the extension is another process, so the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), and its holder keys in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Keychain access group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Instance and DPoP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys stay in the app’s own group: the extension presents, but doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receive. The app saves its configuration where the extension can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"read it too.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Register the documents","anchor":"Register-the-documents"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change, register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\") {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Answer in the extension"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)"},{"text":". Only when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sendResponse"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the holder was shown, and answer.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","struct RequestChanged: Error {}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","    @State private var problem: String?","","    \/\/\/ The request's first document as iOS parsed it: what the consent","    \/\/\/ screen shows the holder.","    private var shown: (doctype: String, elements: [MdocPresentation.Element])? {","        guard let document = context.request.presentmentRequests.first?.documentRequestSets.first?.requests.first else {","            return nil","        }","        let elements = document.namespaces.flatMap { namespace, elements in","            elements.map { MdocPresentation.Element(namespace: namespace, identifier: $0.key, retain: $0.value.isRetaining) }","        }","        return (document.documentType, elements)","    }","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            if let problem { Text(problem) }","            Button(\"Share\") { Task { await share(credentialID: nil) } }","            Button(\"Cancel\") { context.cancel() }","        }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the held mdoc `credentialID` (the first candidate when","    \/\/\/ nil), for exactly the document and elements the holder was shown.","    func share(credentialID: String?) async {","        guard let shown, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        do {","            let wallet = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","            try await context.sendResponse { raw in","                _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                    .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","                let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","                \/\/ Answer only what the holder was shown.","                guard let index = presentation.request.documents.firstIndex(where: { $0.doctype == shown.doctype }),","                      Set(presentation.request.documents[index].elements) == Set(shown.elements),","                      let chosen = credentialID ?? presentation.request.documents[index].credentials.first?.id else {","                    throw RequestChanged()","                }","                \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","                let response = try await presentation.respond(document: index, credentialID: chosen, elements: shown.elements)","                return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","            }","        } catch {","            \/\/ Nothing was shared: say so, and let the holder cancel.","            problem = \"Not shared: \\(error)\"","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The response answers the elements the holder was shown, not those the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"released request names, and a request that changed in between is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refused. Where the consent screen names the reader (below), compare its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/readerCertificate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" there","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"too. The demo wallet’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentProvider"},{"text":" target does all of this, with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a choice of credential and a linkability warning.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Name the reader","anchor":"Name-the-reader","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"text":" accepts only certificates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issued for readers, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Warn of linkable presentations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Presenting to Safari","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/Request-swift.struct/readerCertificate":{"title":"readerCertificate","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/request-swift.struct\/readercertificate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"That reader’s certificate, DER; nil without one. Compare"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates, not names: two can share a name."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/readerCertificate","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"readerCertificate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"title":"holderAccessGroup","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every key is in the default group."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MdocPresentation","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"text":" request (ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7 Annex C): show","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"request"},{"text":" for the holder’s consent, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"respond"},{"text":" once; to decline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancel the platform’s request — nothing is sent to the reader.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"respond","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"document","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentialID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC7ElementV","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Response","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC8ResponseV"}],"type":"topic","title":"respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents the held mdoc "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"credentialID"},{"type":"text","text":" for document number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"document"},{"type":"text","text":", disclosing exactly "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"elements"},{"type":"text","text":", each one it requested."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The holder key signs now, so a key store requiring user presence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prompts."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/respond(document:credentialid:elements:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"text":"A store in the app group ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its extensions listing the group in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.security.application-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement share.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inAppGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"ki